{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_000332_p14_b8", "persona_id": "db:14", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "4. 销售前应提前准备竞品对比数据和权威评测，避免被客户质疑时措手不及。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_000931"}
